---
import AppLanding from "@/layouts/AppLanding";

const meta = {
	title: "Comprar una tablet",
	description:
		"A Spanish WordPress blog with tablet reviews, comparisons and buying guides. Around 90 posts between 2014 and 2016.",
};
---

<AppLanding slug="comprar-una-tablet" {...meta}>
	<p class="mb-4">
		A Spanish blog about tablets. Reviews, head to head comparisons, buying guides. The tagline
		was "la verdad sobre cada tablet, que no te engañen": the truth about every tablet, don't
		let them fool you.
	</p>
	<p class="mb-4">
		Built on WordPress, monetised with affiliate links, promoted through a Facebook page.
		Around 90 posts over two years, covering everything from the BQ Edison to the iPad Pro
		to Remix OS.
	</p>
	<p class="mb-4">
		It was my first go at SEO and writing for search intent. The domain is gone, but the
		Wayback Machine still has it.
	</p>
</AppLanding>
